好的。Okay (好的). Let's start with Problem 1 (问题 1). We have a tank (水箱) with a small hole (小孔) at the bottom. The tank (水箱) has cross-sectional area (横截面积) A, and the hole (小孔) has cross-sectional area (横截面积) a. Initially (初始时), the water depth (水深) is h₀. We want to find the time (时间) T₁ it takes for the tank to empty (排空). We can use Torricelli's law (托里拆利定律): the outflow speed (出流速度) v = √(2gh), where g is gravity (重力加速度) and h is the instantaneous water depth (瞬时水深). The volume flow rate (体积流量) is a·v = a·√(2gh). This equals the rate of decrease (减少率) of water volume (水的体积) in the tank (水箱), which is -A·dh/dt. So we have: -A·dh/dt = a·√(2gh). Rearranging (整理): dh/√h = -(a/A)·√(2g)·dt. Integrate (积分) from h=h₀ to h=0, and t from 0 to T₁: ∫_{h₀}^{0} h^{-1/2} dh = -(a/A)·√(2g)·∫_{0}^{T₁} dt. Left side (左侧): [2√h]_{h₀}^{0} = -2√h₀. Thus (因此): -2√h₀ = -(a/A)·√(2g)·T₁. So (所以): T₁ = (2A)/(a)·√(h₀/(2g)) = (A/a)·√(2h₀/g). Now, Part (b) (第b部分): The tank (水箱)
is initially filled with water to depth h₀, but the small hole (小孔) is at a height (高度) d above the bottom (底部). Water flows out until the water level (水位) reaches height d. So the initial depth (初始水深) is h₀, final depth (最终水深) is d. We use the same differential equation (微分方程): -A·dh/dt = a·√(2g(h-d))? Wait (等等), careful (小心): The effective head (有效水头) is the vertical distance (垂直距离) from the water surface (水面) to the hole (小孔). When water depth (水深) is h, the hole (小孔) is at height d, so the head (水头) is h - d. So Torricelli (托里拆利): v = √(2g(h-d)). Then: -A·dh/dt = a·√(2g(h-d)). Rearrange (整理): dh/√(h-d) = -(a/A)·√(2g)·dt. Integrate (积分) from h=h₀ to h=d: ∫_{h₀}^{d} (h-d)^{-1/2} dh = -(a/A)·√(2g)·∫_{0}^{T₂} dt. Left side (左侧): [2√(h-d)]_{h₀}^{d} = 0 - 2√(h₀ - d) = -2√(h₀ - d). Thus (因此): -2√(h₀ - d) = -(a/A)·√(2g)·T₂. So (所以): T₂ = (2A)/(a)·√((h₀ - d)/(2g)) = (A/a)·√(2(h₀ - d)/g). So the answer (答案) is T₂ = (A/a)·√(2(h₀ - d)/g). That is it (就是这样).

